# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ fixed allow-lists

# Must match src/lib/services/definitions.ts (tests/sidecar_helper.test.mjs checks service names, images, prepare and
# the hardening below). Every bundle MUST carry the hardening (host audit M2): cap_drop [ALL], no-new-privileges,
# a pids_limit no higher than `pids_max`, a mem_limit no higher than `mem_max` and exactly the `cap_add` set the
# definition states (security.capAdd). A bundle that lacks any of them is refused, not merely tolerated.
